# icons/

Per-action PNGs, mirroring the endpoint path. The Android companion
fetches them for tiles and home-screen widgets:

    group/sub/action.png       <->  POST /api/group/sub/action

Served at /api/icon/<path>; missing icons are normal (the app walks a
fallback ladder). Any transparent-background PNG works; keep them
square-ish, ~200px.
